@juxt 3.4
# Rules /juxt:status uses to set Red, Amber or Green. Numbers are never generated.
status:
  rag: red   if revert in main or incident(sev1) open
       amber if open question older than 2d or source changed without tests
       green otherwise
view standup:    altitude: team, 3-5 bullets, cite facts
view leadership: altitude: exec, 3 sentences, cite facts, draft only
